        "references_previous": "none",
        "original_paragraph": {
            "SPR Analysis": "Biophysical label-free assays such as those based on SPR are essential tools in generating high-quality data on affinity, kinetic, mechanistic and thermodynamic aspects of interactions between target proteins and potential drug candidates. Interactions between high potency compounds (5, 7, 21, 28, 34, 39, 42 and Vinpocetine) and PDE1A were measured by surface plasmon resonance (SPR) binding assay. The sensorgrams and kinetic parameters of the interactions were shown in Table 2 and Figure 1, 2.",
            "Table 2 caption": "Table 2 Kinetic parameters of the interactions between different compounds and PDE1A by SPR",
            "Table 2 footnotes": "a association constant (ka); b dissociation constant (kd); c the target residence time (τ = 1/kd); d the equilibrium affinity constant (KD = kd/ka).",
            "Figure 1 caption": "Fig. 1. The sensorgrams of compounds 5, 7, 21, 28, 34, 39, 42 and Vinpocetine by SPR",
            "Figure 1 sensorgram labels": "Compound 5: 0.78 μM, 1.56 μM, 3.12 μM, 6.25 μM, 12.50 μM; Compound 7: 0.39 μM, 0.78 μM, 1.56 μM, 3.12 μM, 6.25 μM; Compound 21: 1.56 μM, 3.12 μM, 6.25 μM, 12.50 μM, 25.00 μM; Compound 28: 0.78 μM, 1.56 μM, 3.12 μM, 6.25 μM, 12.50 μM; Compound 34: 0.78 μM, 1.56 μM, 3.12 μM, 6.25 μM, 12.50 μM; Compound 39: 3.12 μM, 6.25 μM, 12.50 μM, 25.00 μM, 50.00 μM; Compound 42: 3.12 μM, 6.25 μM, 12.50 μM, 25.00 μM, 50.00 μM; Vinpocetine: 6.25 μM, 12.50 μM, 25.00 μM, 50.00 μM, 100.00 μM",
            "Figure 2 caption": "Fig. 2. Kinetic map (log ka vs log kd) of compounds 4, 5, 10, 13, 23, 28, 39 and Vinpocetine. The diagonal lines indicate regions of equal affinity.",
            "Table 2 data": "Compound 5: ka = 39.54 (10^3 M^-1 s^-1), kd = 5.14 (10^-2 s^-1), τ = 19.46 (s), KD = 1.30×10^-6 (M); Compound 7: ka = 73.61 (10^3 M^-1 s^-1), kd = 15.84 (10^-2 s^-1), τ = 6.31 (s), KD = 2.15×10^-6 (M); Compound 21: ka = 12.58 (10^3 M^-1 s^-1), kd = 7.91 (10^-2 s^-1), τ = 12.64 (s), KD = 6.33×10^-6 (M); Compound 28: ka = 12.65 (10^3 M^-1 s^-1), kd = 15.92 (10^-2 s^-1), τ = 6.28 (s), KD = 1.26×10^-5 (M); Compound 34: ka = 71.81 (10^3 M^-1 s^-1), kd = 6.77 (10^-2 s^-1), τ = 14.77 (s), KD = 9.43×10^-7 (M); Compound 39: ka = 12.39 (10^3 M^-1 s^-1), kd = 68.34 (10^-2 s^-1), τ = 1.46 (s), KD = 5.56×10^-5 (M); Compound 42: ka = 15.70 (10^3 M^-1 s^-1), kd = 46.33 (10^-2 s^-1), τ = 2.16 (s), KD = 2.95×10^-5 (M); Vinpocetine: ka = 1.50 (10^3 M^-1 s^-1), kd = 13.88 (10^-2 s^-1), τ = 7.20 (s), KD = 9.25×10^-5 (M)"
        },
